  "description": "Vision Automation Framework (VAF) is a fluent test automation framework for .NET on top of Selenium WebDriver. Waits, visibility and interactability are handled for you, so tests read like the steps they describe. For .NET Framework 4.7.2+ and .NET 10, with NUnit, MSTest or xUnit.",
