  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0-beta.1: .NET 10 alongside .NET Framework 4.7.2; no test framework dependency (failed checks throw VafAssertionException; works with NUnit 3 and 4, MSTest and xUnit); only Selenium as a dependency; settings from VAF_* environment variables or app.config. Breaking: BrowserStack, the mobile types, WinFormApplication and InternetExplorer are removed; the MSTest v1 screenshot overload is replaced by LetsSaveScreenshotTo. See \"Migrating from 2.x\" in the README.",
